    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, you can stomp your hoof on the ground. All creatures within 5 feet of you must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC = 8 + your Strength modifier + your proficiency bonus) or take [[/damage 1d6 thunder]] damage. The damage is increased by 1d6 at 5th, 11th, and 17th level.</p>",
